Somehow attributes on expressions are being duplicated when pasted. I don't yet know why. This leads to exponential blowup, enough to cause big problems if a single attributed expression passes through enough macro invocations (e.g. due to recursive macros).
Here's a minimized test case, derived from `rusqlite`.
